<title>HUNGARY: C.Europe's CESI index eases to 1,402.30 points.</title>
<headline>C.Europe's CESI index eases to 1,402.30 points.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index eased on Friday to close at 1,402.30 points, down 6.46 points or 0.46 percent, the Budapest Stock Exchange said on its Reuters page.</p>
<p>The CESI dropped mainly due to the losses of Polish and Slovenian shares.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, reflects trends of 73 shares on the Budapest, Prague, Warsaw, Bratislava and Ljubljana bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
